On Thu, 31 Jul 2003, Erik van Zwet wrote:

> I'd like to use Splus or R to fit a regression tree to a 
> multivariate response variable. In fact, the response 
> variable is a function sampled at 96 time points. I 
> think the deviance at a node should simply be the 
> L2 distance of all the members to their mean vector.
> 
> Hopefully, someone has some code that does this.
> If not, then it seems rpart() could be modified, but 
> having no C experience at all, I'd need some guidelines 
