Dear Joe,

The function outer() does what you want:

> outer(x, y, function(x, y) abs(x-y))
     [,1] [,2] [,3] [,4] 
[1,]    4    3    2    1
[2,]    5    4    3    2
[3,]    6    5    4    3
[4,]    7    6    5    4

I hope that this helps,
 John

