That's essentially how I would do it.  The following contain minor 
refinements on your solution:

plot(c(0, 2*pi), c(-4,4), type="n")
x <- c(0, .5, 1.5, 2)*pi
delta <- 1e-9 # i <- 1
for(i in 1:3){
        xi <- seq(x[i]+delta, x[i+1]-delta, length=100)
        lines(xi, tan(xi))
}
abline(v=x[2:3], lty=3)

hope this helps.  spencer graves

